---
title: Collections
---

# Collections

Brackets (`[ ]`, `{ }`) and object keys inside attribute values should each have their own color.
The `}` of the closing `%}` should keep the delimiter color.

## Arrays

{% map coordinates=[1, 4, 9] /%}

{% map coordinates=[-1.5, 0, 2.25] /%}

{% map coordinates=[$user.roles[0].id, "fixed", true, null] /%}

## Objects

{% map meta={id: "id_123"} /%}

{% map meta={"id": "id_123", "display-name": "Home"} /%}

{% map meta={id: "plain key", visible: true, order: 2} /%}

## Nested

{% map meta={tags: ["a", "b"], position: {x: 1, y: 2}} /%}

{% map coordinates=[1, 4, 9] meta={id: "id_123", owner: $user.name} /%}

## Brace right before the closing delimiter

{% map meta={a: {b: 1}}/%}

{% map coordinates=[1, {x: 2}]/%}

## Multi-line

{% map
   coordinates=[
     1,
     4,
     9
   ]
   meta={
     id: "id_123",
     "label": "Home"
   }
/%}
